    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Buggy are delighted to bring to the market this beautifully presented two-bedroom first-floor apartment at 112 Rinuccini, ideally positioned just off the Dublin Road in Portlaoise.\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, this beautifully refurbished apartment offers a wonderful combination of modern style, comfort and convenience. Finished to a high standard throughout, the property is ready for its new owner to simply move in and enjoy.\r\nAt the heart of the home is a stylish designer kitchen with appliances, while the generous living accommodation provides a comfortable space to relax and entertain. There are two large bedrooms with fitted wardrobes and a large family bathroom.\r\nThe location is a major attraction. Portlaoise Hospital is just a few minutes' walk away, while the M7 motorway is approximately one minute's drive, making this an excellent choice for commuters. A host of everyday amenities are also within easy walking distance, including shops, schools, hotels, leisure facilities and more.\r\nThe apartment further benefits from gas central heating, double-glazed PVC windows, designated parking and an excellent BER rating.\r\nWhether you're searching for your first home, looking to downsize, seeking a convenient base for commuting or simply want a beautifully finished apartment in an excellent location, 112 Rinuccini is a property that deserves to be viewed.\r\nProperties of this calibre and in such a convenient location are sure to attract strong interest. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate what this apartment has to offer.\r\nContact Property Partners Buggy today to arrange your viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Immaculate condition\r\nClose to all amenities\r\nExcellent location\r\nVery popular development\r\nGas central heating\r\nOn-site management company\r\nDesignated parking\r\nExcellent BER rating, qualifies for Green Mortgage."
      },
